# List the source repositories' proper names, one per line. Copy this file to .confidential-terms to use it.
# .confidential-terms is listed in .gitignore and never committed.
# Matching is case-insensitive. Everything after # is a comment.
# Terms may be in any script (for example, katakana as well as romaji).
#
# What to list
#   - Client names (including abbreviations and domains)
#   - Project, service, and campaign names
#   - Project-specific class names, IDs, and CSS variable prefixes
#   - Source repository and organization names
#
# Examples:
# ExampleClient
# exmp-
